    description "The Panth&#233;on (French: [p&#593;&#771;.te.&#596;&#771;] , from Ancient Greek &#960;&#940;&#957;&#952;&#949;&#953;&#959;&#957; (p&#225;ntheion) '[temple] to all the gods') is a monument in the 5th arrondissement of Paris, France. It stands in the Latin Quarter (Quartier Latin), on the Montagne Sainte-Genevi&#232;ve, in the centre of the Place du Panth&#233;on, which was named after it."
    destination_id "PAR"
