    avg_visit_minutes 60
    price_level 0
    popularity_score 4.77
    description "Montparnasse Cemetery (French: Cimeti&#232;re du Montparnasse [simtj&#603;&#641; d&#601; m&#596;&#771;pa&#641;nas]) is a cemetery in the Montparnasse quarter of Paris, in the city's 14th arrondissement. The cemetery is roughly 19 hectares (47 acres) and is the second largest cemetery in Paris. The cemetery has over 35,000 graves, and approximately 1,000 people are buried there each year. The cemetery is the resting place for a variety of individuals including political figures, philosophers, artists, actors, and writers."
    destination_id "PAR"
